{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the magical tale of Captain Smokey Ifyagardy as he tries to plunder the North Pole in this action-packed, snowball-throwing adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Swashbuckler's Xmas</strong>, you'll need to get past elves, snowmen, and much more in order to find the treasures that abound in the land of Santa's workshop. With easy-to-learn, third-person gameplay and a semi-open world full of secrets to explore, <strong>Swashbuckler's Xmas</strong> will surely have something to make your pirate's heart throb!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Is this an Early Access title?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In spirit, YES. In reality, no. The backstory: This is our first game release and we didn't realize you couldn't participate in Early Access <i>after</i> releasing your game. We had intended to be in Early Access for six months to a year after launch.\u00a0 <strong>Swashbuckler's Xmas is still in active development</strong> and we just released\u00a0a huge 1.0 release. There's never been a better time to play!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, arcade-style snowball fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whimsical, holiday-themed levels full of Christmas cheer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of treasures to collect and secrets to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hundred-year-old talking parrot</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessibility Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remappable Inputs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-aim</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty levels</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Elfton, Ho!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2745260/05ee0c0402b3af442f1536e51b8c9e356615faba.jpg"},{"name":"Approaching the 