 cheer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of treasures to collect and secrets to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hundred-year-old talking parrot</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessibility Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remappable Inputs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-aim</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty levels</p></li></ul>","developers":["North Shore Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745260/b493ed29cbbf40aca69d56c28e4e26892fcc75f9/header.jpg?t=1770092965","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2025 North Shore Games","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2745260/603995112/c9424756106c38212630e52fb66f9955867962d6/1766516608/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766517712","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2745260/603995112/c9424756106c38212630e52fb66f9955867962d6/1766516608/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766517712","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2745260/603995112/c9424756106c38212630e52fb66f9955867962d6/1766516608/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766517712","id":257254697,"name":"2025 Steam Winter Sale Promo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257254697/38a9d9ae49113aa94d81dd516c0167daaa61a316/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766517712"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamst